{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Overview]<br>A 2D Action RPG About a Slime Climbing the Ranks to Become a Pro Gamer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise from nothing to victory.<br>Absorb your enemies\u2019 abilities and fight your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Features]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a unique ranking system by earning Rank Points (RP) instead of simply clearing stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb abilities from defeated enemies\u2014especially bosses\u2014to expand your strategic options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >360-degree wall-crawling action across floors, walls, and ceilings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge Jump system: control jump height freely by holding the button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Stage Details (Volume)]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages are structured like competitive e-sports rank tiers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bronze<br>Silver<br>Gold<br>Platinum<br>Diamond<br>Master<br>Pro</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Bronze to Diamond, each rank contains four stages (I\u2013IV).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer all 22 stages and defeat 7 bosses to become a true professional gamer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Simple Rules\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action RPG where you aim for the final \u201cPro\u201d stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Rank Points (RP) to unlock boss stages for each rank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy equipment, strengthen abilities, and learn skills in the shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death results in losing RP and gold (penalties increase in later ranks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your performance\u2014clear time, enemies defeated, and more\u2014is converted into score, which becomes your reward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleared stages grant reduced rewards upon replay<br><br>\u3010Other\u3011<br>Auto-save supported</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ability Absorption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044210/9384a7f921931f5c9c0661696d01eefbe3855628.jpg"},{"name":"Pro Gamar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044210/37327a1f0df4b1ae8b204e272b67ccffe44faac9.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044210/734bb6859ca7e176973d040cbf9490446f4e029f.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044210/5f61f3cef35fb35346471699d1c0f41a043ab9ea.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044210/d79e660c21813ace1716c6c85e78a08ed25be07a.jpg"},{"name":"Platinum Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044210/3c6e3f076e48a7263744ad796b3eeee1440ec0d1.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044210/8f58974ca82f88f10d090f794e1be864e0bd5f64.jpg"},{"name":"Master Rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4044210/c7b2d957ad751abd4f6ec2a8b1a4ff060242ac88.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044210?t=1771586105","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044210?t=1771586105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044210/99f0ef64a5f8ee0ce2373c9ed8eb54449d89ff11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771586105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044210/99f0ef64a5f8ee0ce2373c9ed8eb54449d89ff11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771